    "q-104871": {
      "dom_id": "step-q104871",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Let $V={R}_{1}[t],$ the vector space of real polynomials of degree at most $1,$ and let the inner product on $V$ be defined as\n\n$$\n⟨p(t),q(t)⟩=p(0)q(0)+p(1)q(1).\n$$\n\nNow consider the following elements of $V:$\n\n$$\n{p}_{1}(t)=2t,\\,{p}_{2}(t)=t-1,\\,q(t)=4t-3\n$$\n\nFind the orthogonal projection of $q(t)$ onto $S=\\text{Span}\\{{p}_{1}(t),{p}_{2}(t)\\}$ given that ${p}_{1}(t)⊥{p}_{2}(t)$ with respect to the inner product, and that the orthogonal projection of $q(t)$ onto $\\text{Span}\\{{p}_{1}(t)\\}$ equals $t.$",
      "worked_solution": "Since the set $\\{{p}_{1}(t),{p}_{2}(t)\\}$ is orthogonal, the orthogonal projection of $q(t)$ onto the subspace $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,q(t)={\\text{proj}}_{{p}_{1}(t)}\\,q(t)+{\\text{proj}}_{{p}_{2}(t)}\\,q(t).\n$$\n\nWe are given that ${\\text{proj}}_{{p}_{1}(t)}\\,q(t)=t,$ so let's now find the orthogonal projection of $q(t)$ onto $\\text{Span}\\{{p}_{2}(t)\\}.$ This can be computed as\n\n$$\n{\\text{proj}}_{{p}_{2}(t)}\\,q(t)=\\frac{⟨q(t),{p}_{2}(t)⟩}{⟨{p}_{2}(t),{p}_{2}(t)⟩}\\,{p}_{2}(t).\n$$\n\n \n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨q(t),{p}_{2}(t)⟩ & =q(0){p}_{2}(0)+q(1){p}_{2}(1) \\\\  & =(4t-3){|}_{0}\\cdot (t-1){|}_{0}+(4t-3){|}_{1}\\cdot (t-1){|}_{1} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot (-1)+1\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨{p}_{2}(t),{p}_{2}(t)⟩ & ={p}_{2}(0){p}_{2}(0)+{p}_{2}(1){p}_{2}(1) \\\\  & =(t-1)^{2}{|}_{0}+(t-1)^{2}{|}_{1} \\\\  & =(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{{p}_{2}(t)}\\,q(t) & =\\frac{3}{1}\\cdot (t-1)=3t-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,q(t) & ={\\text{proj}}_{{p}_{1}(t)}\\,q(t)+{\\text{proj}}_{{p}_{2}(t)}\\,q(t) \\\\  & =t+(3t-3) \\\\  & =4t-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-104871-a",
